# Ignorar a pasta bin
bin/

cache/
# Derived pipeline output; kept local now that the project is moving off
# committing data to git (see scripts/data-snapshot.sh).
# Corpus snapshots (scripts/data-snapshot.sh) live OUTSIDE the worktree in
# $COOPS_SNAPSHOT_DIR (default: ~/.local/share/coops/snapshots), shared across
# worktrees, so nothing under the repo needs ignoring for them. If you point
# COOPS_SNAPSHOT_DIR into a checkout, ignore that path here.
# Ignorar arquivos de log

*.log

